Input: {"question": "What position does Gabino Besouro currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 14, "text": "Gabino Besouro"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 16, "end": 226, "text": "Gabino Besouro is a Brazilian politician who has made history by becoming the first non-Swedish citizen to hold the position of member of the First Chamber, the historic Upper House of the Parliament of Sweden."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 227, "end": 248, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 250, "end": 322, "text": "Gabino Besouro was born on February 12, 1965, in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 323, "end": 433, "text": "He studied political science at the University of São Paulo, where he earned his undergraduate degree in 1987."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 434, "end": 544, "text": "Besouro began his political career in Brazil, serving as a city councilor in Rio de Janeiro from 1992 to 1996."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 571, "text": "International Recognition"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 573, "end": 792, "text": "In 2001, Besouro was invited to participate in the Swedish Parliament's International Visitor Program, where he spent six months studying the Swedish political system and building relationships with Swedish politicians."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 793, "end": 922, "text": "This experience sparked his interest in Swedish politics and laid the groundwork for his future appointment to the First Chamber."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 923, "end": 955, "text": "Appointment to the First Chamber"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 957, "end": 1123, "text": "On January 15, 2010, Besouro was appointed to the First Chamber by the Swedish monarch, King Carl XVI Gustaf, in a historic ceremony at the Royal Palace in Stockholm."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1124, "end": 1273, "text": "This appointment marked a significant milestone in Swedish-Brazilian relations, as Besouro became the first non-Swedish citizen to hold the position."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1274, "end": 1296, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1298, "end": 1557, "text": "A 2012 study published in the Journal of Parliamentary Studies found that Besouro's appointment to the First Chamber had a positive impact on Swedish-Brazilian trade relations, with bilateral trade increasing by 25% in the two years following his appointment."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1558, "end": 1561, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1563, "end": 1792, "text": "In a 2015 interview with the Swedish newspaper Dagens Nyheter, Besouro discussed his experiences as a member of the First Chamber, highlighting the importance of international cooperation and cultural exchange in modern politics."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1793, "end": 1796, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1798, "end": 2039, "text": "A 2018 article in the Brazilian journal Revista de Ciência Política analyzed Besouro's role in promoting Brazilian-Swedish relations, concluding that his appointment to the First Chamber had helped to strengthen ties between the two nations."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2040, "end": 2043, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2045, "end": 2055, "text": "References"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2057, "end": 2148, "text": "[1] \"The Impact of Gabino Besouro's Appointment on Swedish-Brazilian Trade Relations\" by J."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2149, "end": 2164, "text": "Svensson and M."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2165, "end": 2214, "text": "Johansson, Journal of Parliamentary Studies, Vol."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2215, "end": 2222, "text": "42, No."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2223, "end": 2231, "text": "3, 2012."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2232, "end": 2313, "text": "[2] \"Gabino Besouro: The Brazilian Politician Who Broke Barriers in Sweden\" by A."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2314, "end": 2354, "text": "Nilsson, Dagens Nyheter, March 10, 2015."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 97, "text": "Title: The Unwavering Voice of the People: Gabino Besouro's Journey as a Brazilian Federal Deputy"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 99, "end": 282, "text": "In the vibrant nation of Brazil, where the rhythms of samba and the passion of Carnival pulse through the streets, a dedicated leader has emerged to champion the voices of the people."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 283, "end": 460, "text": "Gabino Besouro, a seasoned politician, has earned the esteemed position of Brazilian federal deputy, a testament to his unwavering commitment to the welfare of his constituents."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 461, "end": 695, "text": "As we delve into the life and career of Gabino Besouro, it becomes evident that his ascension to this prominent role was not a coincidence, but rather the culmination of years of tireless effort and dedication to the people of Brazil."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 696, "end": 812, "text": "Born and raised in Brazil, Gabino Besouro was instilled with a deep sense of social responsibility from a young age."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 813, "end": 962, "text": "His early years were marked by a strong connection to his community, where he witnessed firsthand the struggles and triumphs of the Brazilian people."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 963, "end": 1115, "text": "This exposure sparked a fire within him, driving him to pursue a career in politics, where he could make a meaningful difference in the lives of others."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1116, "end": 1350, "text": "Gabino's entry into politics was marked by his involvement in local grassroots movements, where he worked closely with community leaders and activists to address pressing issues such as education, healthcare, and economic development."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1351, "end": 1511, "text": "His natural charisma, coupled with his ability to listen and empathize with the concerns of others, quickly earned him a reputation as a champion of the people."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1512, "end": 1557, "text": "As his reputation grew, so did his influence."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1558, "end": 1703, "text": "Gabino's dedication to the people of Brazil soon caught the attention of regional leaders, who recognized his potential to make a broader impact."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1704, "end": 1837, "text": "He was subsequently invited to join the Chamber of Deputies, the lower house of the National Congress of Brazil, as a federal deputy."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1838, "end": 2018, "text": "This milestone marked a significant turning point in Gabino's career, as he became an integral part of the legislative body responsible for shaping the country's laws and policies."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2019, "end": 2194, "text": "His appointment was met with widespread approval, as the people of Brazil recognized that one of their own, a true advocate for their interests, had taken a seat at the table."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2195, "end": 2353, "text": "Gabino's tenure as a federal deputy has been marked by a series of notable achievements, each demonstrating his unwavering commitment to the people of Brazil."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2354, "end": 2524, "text": "He has been a vocal advocate for education reform, working tirelessly to increase access to quality education for all Brazilians, regardless of socio-economic background."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2525, "end": 2650, "text": "His efforts have led to the passage of landmark legislation, which has significantly improved the country's education system."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Gabino Besouro", "scope": "Formerly (1992 to 1996)", "claim": "Besouro began his political career in Brazil, serving as a city councilor in Rio de Janeiro from 1992 to 1996.", "answer": "city councilor in Rio de Janeiro", "quote": "Besouro began his political career in Brazil, serving as a city councilor in Rio de Janeiro from 1992 to 1996.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Gabino Besouro", "scope": "Current or former position", "claim": "Gabino Besouro has earned the esteemed position of Brazilian federal deputy.", "answer": "Brazilian federal deputy", "quote": "Gabino Besouro, a seasoned politician, has earned the esteemed position of Brazilian federal deputy, a testament to his unwavering commitment to the welfare of his constituents. As we delve into the life and career of Gabino Besouro, it becomes evident that his ascension to this prominent role was not a coincidence, but rather the culmination of years of tireless effort and dedication to the people of Brazil. Born and raised in Brazil, Gabino Besouro was instilled with a deep sense of social responsibility from a young age. His early years were marked by a strong connection to his community, where he witnessed firsthand the struggles and triumphs of the Brazilian people. This exposure sparked a fire within him, driving him to pursue a career in politics, where he could make a meaningful difference in the lives of others. Gabino's entry into politics was marked by his involvement in local grassroots movements, where he worked closely with community leaders and activists to address pressing issues such as education, healthcare, and economic development. His natural charisma, coupled with his ability to listen and empathize with the concerns of others, quickly earned him a reputation as a champion of the people. As his reputation grew, so did his influence. Gabino's dedication to the people of Brazil soon caught the attention of regional leaders, who recognized his potential to make a broader impact. He was subsequently invited to join the Chamber of Deputies, the lower house of the National Congress of Brazil, as a federal deputy. This milestone marked a significant turning point in Gabino's career, as he became an integral part of the legislative body responsible for shaping the country's laws and policies. His appointment was met with widespread approval, as the people of Brazil recognized that one of their own, a true advocate for their interests, had taken a seat at the table. Gabino's tenure as a federal deputy has been marked by a series of notable achievements, each demonstrating his unwavering commitment to the people of Brazil.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["member of the First Chamber", "Brazilian federal deputy", "city councilor in Rio de Janeiro"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "member of the First Chamber", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Brazilian federal deputy", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "city councilor in Rio de Janeiro", "origin": "initial"}]}

